 the game challenges you to think in systems.<br>You’ll route energy, control logic gates, activate hidden conditions, sometimes remotely, sometimes under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles ask you to <i>solve</i>. Others ask you to <i>observe</i>.<br>The solution may not be in front of you, but above, behind, or hidden in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/4dda7a869eabf1be9e7390e4eecb7f3f.poster.avif?t=1787823192\" width=860 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/4dda7a869eabf1be9e7390e4eecb7f3f.webm?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/4dda7a869eabf1be9e7390e4eecb7f3f.mp4?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/ee17b7ca941b0477ba013426bb675695.avif?t=1787823192\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the simulation with agility and style using your traversal-enhanced suit:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash</strong> past dangers or across collapsing floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double jump</strong> for extended reach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb and vault</strong> through vertical spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse environments built around <strong>rhythm, physics and timing</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your movement matters. It’s not just how you solve, it’s <i>where</i> you can go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/63cdbdea6e7cfe280158c1ce78472108.poster.avif?t=1787823192\" width=860 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/63cdbdea6e7cfe280158c1ce78472108.webm?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/63cdbdea6e7cfe280158c1ce78472108.mp4?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/110777d4c29295ef8b375f105a5c43da.avif?t=1787823192\" width=800 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your integrated <strong>Scan Pulse</strong> reveals what's not immediately visible.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detect clues embedded in the walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highlight interactive objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reveal hidden inputs or power lines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track connections across rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover temperature zones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some secrets simply won’t show themselves without it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/254e9660085ede5f2c55563a1e1f652f.poster.avif?t=1787823192\" width=860 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/254e9660085ede5f2c55563a1e1f652f.webm?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/254e9660085ede5f2c55563a1e1f652f.mp4?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/2ea4e9cfe1c47eec74e1a92b446a4eda.avif?t=1787823192\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deployable drone gives you eyes and access where you can’t follow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through vents and maintenance shafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger pressure pads or switches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe puzzles from alternate angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate hostile or unstable areas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rooms are designed for two, <strong>you and the drone</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/867252c0f793f04c1070fc1a2b1498ba.poster.avif?t=1787823192\" width=860 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/867252c0f793f04c1070fc1a2b1498ba.webm?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/867252c0f793f04c1070fc1a2b1498ba.mp4?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/ac8ece4bfaf1f0fa59b3000eec2f4fcb.avif?t=1787823192\" width=800 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is part of something larger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each is tied to a <strong>Clue Thread</strong>, a narrative arc in the mind of Dr. Noah Valen.  <br> Some puzzles are required. Others are hidden, optional… and sometimes don’t want to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional challenge rooms represent <strong>Noah’s subconscious</strong> — raw, unstable fragments of his mind. <br>Here, puzzles are symbolic, harder, and offer deeper insight into the truth he’s trying to bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/2bf29cb46795fb4eb2f7486e4f3b5e6e.poster.avif?t=1787823192\" width=860 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/2bf29cb46795fb4eb2f7486e4f3b5e6e.webm?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/2bf29cb46795fb4eb2f7486e4f3b5e6e.mp4?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/7349290b250cc481630d9466a7718b47.avif?t=1787823192\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From sterile chambers to warped halls swallowed by shadow, no two areas look or feel alike.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environments constructed from memories, emotion, and trauma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighting and architecture that tell the story without a word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Areas that <i>change</i> as you complete objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sense of isolation, discovery, and wrongness, that builds constantly</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress deeper into the simulation, reality begins to fracture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaces twist, logic breaks, and the world around you becomes a reflection of a mind unraveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/5a3f0659294816e99cf391e3bbf309b7.poster.avif?t=1787823192\" width=860 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/5a3f0659294816e99cf391e3bbf309b7.webm?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/extras/5a3f0659294816e99cf391e3bbf309b7.mp4?t=1787823192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A first-person puzzle-platformer psychological horror where you explore the fragmented mind of a murderer to uncover the truth behind a tragic space station massacre.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/d698803affe5e71c13e3f59d5f435d97699c59fc/header.jpg?t=1787823192", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/0c11d8ccb3ae08b15aaa3d71e6a4665a471e5529/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787823192", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522860/0c11d8ccb3ae08b15aaa3d71e6a4665a471e5529/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787823192", "website": "https://projectenceladus.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or Intel Core i5-9600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Nem</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</stron